# Local project context for Claude Code.
# Deliberately untracked: it records in-progress decisions, machine-specific
# setup notes and working preferences -- useful locally, but not something a
# public portfolio repo should ship. Claude Code reads it directly from disk,
# so ignoring it here does not hide it from tooling on this machine.
# Caveat: it will NOT travel with a fresh clone. Keep a backup if this repo
# ever becomes the only copy.
# Both spellings listed because the file has been known by each, and ignore
# matching is case-sensitive on Linux/macOS even though Windows is not.
CLAUDE.md
Claude.md
